    <string name="about_what_is_title">What it is</string>
    <string name="about_what_is_body">A free, open-source IPTV player for Android TV, Fire TV and phones. It\'s a player only — it doesn\'t supply channels; you connect the service you already pay for. Nothing you enter leaves your device except to talk to your own provider.</string>
    <string name="about_built_open_title">Built in the open</string>
    <string name="about_built_open_body">OpenTV Mobile is developed openly, with AI doing a large share of the coding under human direction — that\'s stated plainly, not hidden. Because it\'s open source, no single person going away can take it down: anyone can read every line, build it, and carry it on.</string>
    <string name="about_support_title">Support the project</string>
    <string name="about_support_body">OpenTV Mobile is free and always will be — nothing is gated. If it’s useful to you and you’d like to chip in, a coffee on Ko-fi keeps the Android development going. It’s built on OpenTV, so the original authors’ links are here too.</string>
